    "兼容播放控制层：播放/暂停、进度拖动、音轨与字幕菜单、倍速菜单，双击两侧快退/快进 10 秒": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatibility player controls: play/pause, scrubbing, audio and subtitle menus, a speed menu, and double-tap either side to skip 10 seconds."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兼容播放控制层：播放/暂停、进度拖动、音轨与字幕菜单、倍速菜单，双击两侧快退/快进 10 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内封图形字幕（PGS 等）无法在系统播放中显示，可切换兼容播放查看": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedded image subtitles (such as PGS) can’t be shown with the system player. Switch to compatibility playback to view them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内封图形字幕（PGS 等）无法在系统播放中显示，可切换兼容播放查看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内封图形字幕（PGS 等）无法在系统播放中显示，可切换直读播放查看": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedded picture subtitles (such as PGS) can't be displayed in Native Mode. Switch to direct playback to view them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内封图形字幕（PGS 等）无法在系统播放中显示，可切换直读播放查看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
