    "单个大文件（几个 GB）经系统选择器导出会很慢，建议用上面的「添加文件夹」加入它所在的文件夹。也可以把视频拷进「文件」App 里 Lumen 的文件夹，下次打开 App 时会自动入库。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Large files (several GB) export slowly through the system picker. Use Add Folder above for the folder that contains the file instead, or copy videos into the Lumen folder in the Files app — they are added automatically on next launch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单个大文件（几个 GB）经系统选择器导出会很慢，建议用上面的「添加文件夹」加入它所在的文件夹。也可以把视频拷进「文件」App 里 Lumen 的文件夹，下次打开 App 时会自动入库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原生模式": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native Mode"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原生模式不可用，已切换直读播放": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native Mode unavailable. Switched to direct playback."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生模式不可用，已切换直读播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原生模式仅列出可叠加显示的文本字幕；图形字幕请用直读播放查看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native Mode lists only text subtitles that can be overlaid. Use direct playback for picture subtitles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生模式仅列出可叠加显示的文本字幕；图形字幕请用直读播放查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原生模式播放时生成的无损重封装文件会缓存在本机，可在此清除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Losslessly remuxed files created in Native Mode are cached on this device and can be cleared here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生模式播放时生成的无损重封装文件会缓存在本机，可在此清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双字幕：内封字幕全列表可选，主字幕与副字幕可同时显示；默认优先简体中文，选择按剧集与全局记忆": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual subtitles: choose from the full embedded subtitle list and show primary and secondary subtitles at the same time. Simplified Chinese is preferred by default, and choices are remembered per show and globally."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双字幕：内封字幕全列表可选，主字幕与副字幕可同时显示；默认优先简体中文，选择按剧集与全局记忆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双引擎播放：MKV 等格式先无损重封装后用系统播放器播放，原生输出高动态范围与空间音频；系统不支持的格式自动切换兼容播放，直接读取原文件": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual-engine playback: MKV and similar formats are losslessly remuxed for the system player, with native HDR and spatial audio; unsupported formats switch to compatibility playback and read the original file directly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双引擎播放：MKV 等格式先无损重封装后用系统播放器播放，原生输出高动态范围与空间音频；系统不支持的格式自动切换兼容播放，直接读取原文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双引擎播放：优先无损重封装＋系统播放器，原生输出高动态范围与空间音频；格式不支持时自动切换兼容播放，MKV 直接读取。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual-engine playback: lossless remux with the system player first, for native HDR and spatial audio. Unsupported formats switch to the compatibility player, which reads MKV directly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双引擎播放：优先无损重封装＋系统播放器，原生输出高动态范围与空间音频；格式不支持时自动切换兼容播放，MKV 直接读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
