    "在「文件源」页点「添加文件夹」，选一次文件夹，之后每次打开 App 都会自动把里面的新视频加入媒体库。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the Sources page, tap Add Folder and pick a folder once. New videos inside are added automatically on every launch."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「文件源」页点「添加文件夹」，选一次文件夹，之后每次打开 App 都会自动把里面的新视频加入媒体库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
