            "value": "Add a folder as a source and videos are added automatically.\nMKV files are losslessly converted for the system player; unsupported formats switch to the compatibility player automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个文件夹作为文件源，视频会自动入库。\nMKV 自动无损转换后以系统播放器播放，特殊格式自动切换兼容播放。"
          }
        }
      }
